          <main>
          <section id="overview" class="report-view report-view-overview" aria-label="Visual overview">
          <header class="view-heading"><h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">The collaboration at a glance</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">一眼看見協作方式</span></h2><p><span data-l="en" lang="en">Patterns, rhythm and workflow. Continue to the second page for the story and its evidence.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">先看協作偏好、使用節奏與工作流程，再到第二頁閱讀互動故事與證據。</span></p></header>
          <section class="sigs" aria-label="Measured signature">
            <div class="sig tip tip-l" data-tip-en="Share of prompts sent between 22:00 and 04:59" data-tip-zh-TW="22:00 到 04:59 之間送出的 prompt 比例" tabindex="-1">
    <b>19%</b><span><span data-l="en" lang="en">at night</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">在深夜</span></span>
  </div>
            <div class="sig tip " data-tip-en="Median prompt length in characters, after cleaning" data-tip-zh-TW="清理後 prompt 長度的中位數（字元）" tabindex="-1">
    <b><span data-l="en" lang="en">86 chars</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">86 字</span></b><span><span data-l="en" lang="en">typical prompt</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">典型 prompt 長度</span></span>
  </div>
            <div class="sig tip " data-tip-en="Prompts that push back on the AI&#39;s answer (e.g. &quot;no, that&#39;s wrong&quot;)" data-tip-zh-TW="反駁 AI 回答的 prompt，例如「不對」「錯了」" tabindex="-1">
    <b><span data-l="en" lang="en">1 in 8</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">每 8 則</span></b><span><span data-l="en" lang="en">prompts corrects the AI</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">prompt 就有一次糾正 AI</span></span>
  </div>
            <div class="sig tip tip-r" data-tip-en="Average number of prompts in one conversation" data-tip-zh-TW="一次對話平均有幾則 prompt" tabindex="-1">
    <b>6.3</b><span><span data-l="en" lang="en">prompts per session</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">每個 session 的 prompt 數</span></span>
  </div>
          </section>


          <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">A collaboration portrait is not available in this profile. The detail page contains the available observations.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">這份 profile 尚未包含協作側寫；第二頁仍可閱讀既有的觀察與證據。</span></p>
          <div class="overview-charts">
    <article class="panel"><h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">Which tools appear in conversations?</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">對話中出現哪些工具？</span></h2>
      <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">A session is one recorded conversation. Tool records describe agent activity, not the person’s ability. Categories overlap; percentages need not add to 100%.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">一個 session 是一段對話紀錄。工具紀錄呈現 AI 助手的活動，不代表使用者的能力。類別可重疊，百分比不必合計為 100%。</span></p>
      <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Source: local tool records. 180 of 312 sessions have metadata. Each value shows the percentage and sessions using that tool / covered sessions. Uncovered sessions are unknown.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">來源：本機工具紀錄。共 312 段對話，其中 180 段有工具紀錄。每項列出比例，以及使用該工具的對話數／有紀錄的對話數。其餘對話的使用情況未知。</span></p><ul class="overview-bars"><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Ships pull requests</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">發 pull request</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:27%"></i></span>
  <b>27%<small>48 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Delegates to subagents</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">委派子代理</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:26%"></i></span>
  <b>26%<small>47 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Researches the web</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">上網查資料</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:12%"></i></span>
  <b>12%<small>22 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Connects MCP tools</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">串接 MCP 工具</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:11%"></i></span>
  <b>11%<small>20 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Uses skills</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">使用 skills</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:10%"></i></span>
  <b>10%<small>18 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Plans in plan mode</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">用 plan 模式規劃</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:8%"></i></span>
  <b>8%<small>14 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Lets the agent ask</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">讓 agent 反問</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:8%"></i></span>
  <b>8%<small>14 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Runs background work</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">跑背景任務</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:7%"></i></span>
  <b>7%<small>13 / 180</small></b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Isolates work in worktrees</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">用 worktree 隔離工作</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:5%"></i></span>
  <b>5%<small>9 / 180</small></b>
</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="panel"><h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">What do the prompts ask for?</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">提示中提出哪些要求？</span></h2>
      <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Rules detect wording in prompts after cleaning removes injected content. Categories overlap; a match is not a quality grade or proof the request was completed.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">先移除注入內容，再以規則偵測提示文字。類別可重疊；符合規則不代表品質較好，也不代表要求已完成。</span></p>
      <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Source: wording rules applied to 1412 cleaned prompts (the denominator). Each value is the share matching that rule. Exact matching prompt counts are not stored; percentages are rounded.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">來源：以文字規則檢查 1412 則清理後提示，以此為分母。每項數值是符合該規則的比例。報告未儲存各項符合的確切則數，百分比經過四捨五入。</span></p><ul class="overview-bars"><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">States constraints</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">說明限制</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:36%"></i></span>
  <b>36%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Gives error context</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">附上錯誤脈絡</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:31%"></i></span>
  <b>31%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Names files</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">指出檔案</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:27%"></i></span>
  <b>27%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Asks for verification</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">要求驗證</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:24%"></i></span>
  <b>24%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Plans first</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">先規劃</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:22%"></i></span>
  <b>22%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Asks why</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">問為什麼</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:18%"></i></span>
  <b>18%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Structures requests</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">條列需求</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:14%"></i></span>
  <b>14%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Defines done</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">定義完成</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:12%"></i></span>
  <b>12%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Gives examples</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">給範例</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:9%"></i></span>
  <b>9%</b>
</li><li>
  <span class="overview-bar-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Specifies the format</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">指定格式</span></span>
  <span class="overview-bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:7%"></i></span>
  <b>7%</b>
</li></ul>
    </article>
  </div>
