          <header class="view-heading"><h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">The person behind the prompts</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">從對話認識這個人</span></h2><p><span data-l="en" lang="en">Read the interactions, supporting quotes and tools behind the overview. Evidence is expanded by default.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">閱讀總覽背後的互動、原文引述與使用工具。證據預設展開，不必逐一點開。</span></p></header>

          <section>
