          <section class="techniques">
                  <div class="section-head">
                    <h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">How I work with AI</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">我怎麼用 AI</span></h2>
                    <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Tool records show activity; prompt wording shows requests. Neither proves expertise or completed work. Hover for individual definitions.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">工具紀錄顯示活動，提示文字顯示要求；兩者都不能證明專業程度或工作已完成。滑過各項可查看定義。</span></p>
