    <div class="caps"><article class="cap cap-plan">
    <div class="cap-lead"><header>
      <h3><span data-l="en" lang="en">Plan</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">規劃</span></h3>
      <p><span data-l="en" lang="en">Does the work start from a plan?</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">工作是不是從計畫開始？</span></p>
    </header>

    <ul class="cap-ms"><li class="cap-m tip tip-l" data-tip-en="Prompts sent in plan mode, or plan mode entered by the agent · 14 sessions" data-tip-zh-TW="在 plan 模式下送出的 prompt，或 agent 進入 plan 模式 · 14 個 session" tabindex="-1">
    <span class="cap-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Plans in plan mode</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">用 plan 模式規劃</span></span>
    <span class="share-track"><span class="share-fill" style="width:8%"></span></span>
    <b>8%</b>
  </li><li class="cap-m tip tip-l" data-tip-en="Asks for a plan, steps or an outline · 22% of prompts" data-tip-zh-TW="要求計畫、步驟或大綱 · 22% 的 prompt" tabindex="-1">
    <span class="cap-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Plans first</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">先規劃</span></span>
    <span class="share-track"><span class="share-fill" style="width:22%"></span></span>
    <b>22%</b>
  </li><li class="cap-m tip tip-l" data-tip-en="Uses a numbered or bulleted list · 14% of prompts" data-tip-zh-TW="使用編號或條列 · 14% 的 prompt" tabindex="-1">
    <span class="cap-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Structures requests</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">條列需求</span></span>
    <span class="share-track"><span class="share-fill" style="width:14%"></span></span>
    <b>14%</b>
  </li><li class="cap-m tip tip-l" data-tip-en="States the expected result · 12% of prompts" data-tip-zh-TW="寫出預期結果 · 12% 的 prompt" tabindex="-1">
    <span class="cap-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Defines done</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">定義完成</span></span>
    <span class="share-track"><span class="share-fill" style="width:12%"></span></span>
    <b>12%</b>
  </li></ul>
    </div>

  </article><article class="cap cap-delegate">
    <div class="cap-lead"><header>
      <h3><span data-l="en" lang="en">Delegate</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">委派</span></h3>
      <p><span data-l="en" lang="en">How much is handed to agents, and how?</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">交給 agent 多少、怎麼交？</span></p>
    </header>
    <p class="tech-callout"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Up to 4 sessions at once · parallel on 31 days</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">最多同時 4 個 session · 31 天平行作業</span></p>
