          <section class="coaching">
                  <div class="section-head">
                    <h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">Improve your prompts</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">讓 prompt 更好</span></h2>
                    <p class="note"><span data-l="en" lang="en">From your own prompts; each suggestion cites what it is based on</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">來自你自己的 prompt；每個建議都標出根據</span></p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="improves">
                    <article class="improve">
    <header><span class="improve-n">1</span><h3><span data-l="en" lang="en">State the expected result first</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">先講預期結果</span></h3></header>
    <p class="improve-pattern"><span data-l="en" lang="en">You often describe the change and add the real requirement only after the first answer.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">你常先描述要改什麼，等第一次回答後才補上真正的要求。</span></p>
    <p class="improve-impact"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Several follow-ups in this sample start with a correction such as “no, keep the old API”.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">這份樣本裡有幾個追問是以糾正開頭，例如「不對，保留舊的 API」。</span></p>
    <p class="improve-tip"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Put the expected result and the constraints in the first prompt.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">在第一個 prompt 就寫出預期結果和限制。</span></p>
    <div class="rewrite">
            <div>
              <span class="rw-label"><span data-l="en" lang="en">You wrote</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">你寫的</span></span>
              <blockquote>don&#39;t write code yet, break the plan into small steps</blockquote>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="rw-label"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Try</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">可以試試</span></span>
              <p class="rw-after" title="Suggested rewrite">Plan only, no code yet: break the change into small steps, list the risks of each, and keep the public API unchanged.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

  </article><article class="improve">
    <header><span class="improve-n">2</span><h3><span data-l="en" lang="en">Name the file and the error</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">指出檔案和錯誤訊息</span></h3></header>
    <p class="improve-pattern"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Debugging prompts rarely say which file or which error message.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">除錯的 prompt 很少說是哪個檔案、哪個錯誤。</span></p>
    <p class="improve-impact"><span data-l="en" lang="en">The AI has to ask or guess before it can help.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">AI 必須先問或先猜，才能幫上忙。</span></p>
    <p class="improve-tip"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Paste the error line and name the file and function in the same prompt.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">同一個 prompt 裡貼上錯誤那一行，並寫出檔案和函式名稱。</span></p>

    <details open>
            <summary><span data-l="en" lang="en">1 quote as evidence</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">1 段引文佐證</span></summary>
            <ul class="evidence">
    <li><blockquote>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; 這段為什麼會被執行？</blockquote></li>
  </ul>
          </details>
  </article>
                  </div>
                  <h3 class="sub-h"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Signals worth a look</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">值得注意的訊號</span></h3>
                          <ul class="signals">
    <li>
          <b><span data-l="en" lang="en">1 in 8 prompts corrects the AI</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">每 8 則 prompt 就有一次糾正 AI</span></b>
          <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Most corrections add something you already knew: put the expected result and the constraints in the first prompt.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">多數糾正補上的是你早就知道的事：把預期結果和限制寫在第一個 prompt。</span></span>
        </li><li>
          <b><span data-l="en" lang="en">31% of prompts are under ~4 words</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">31% 的 prompt 不到四個字詞</span></b>
          <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Follow-ups like “fix it” make the AI guess. Name the file, the error and what “done” looks like.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">像「改一下」這樣的追問會讓 AI 用猜的。寫出檔案、錯誤訊息，以及怎樣才算完成。</span></span>
        </li><li>
          <b><span data-l="en" lang="en">2 openings start 14 sessions</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">2 種開頭重複用在 14 個 session</span></b>
          <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">If you type these yourself, save them as a slash command, a skill or a CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md note.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">如果這些是你自己打的，把它們存成 slash command、skill，或寫進 CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md。</span></span>
        </li>
  </ul>
                  <div class="progress">
    <h3 class="sub-h">
      <span data-l="en" lang="en">Since your last report (Sep 24, 2026)</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">跟上次報告比（2026年9月24日）</span>
    </h3>
    <ul class="changes">
      <li class="chg good">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Prompts that correct the AI</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">糾正 AI 的 prompt</span></span>
    <b>16% → 12%</b>
    <i>▼ 4</i>
  </li>
      <li class="chg good">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Very short prompts</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">太短的 prompt</span></span>
    <b>38% → 31%</b>
    <i>▼ 7</i>
  </li>
      <li class="chg flat">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Prompts at night</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">深夜的 prompt</span></span>
    <b>21% → 19%</b>
    <i>▼ 2</i>
  </li>
      <li class="chg flat">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Delegates to subagents</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">委派子代理</span></span>
    <b>6% → 26%</b>
    <i>▲ 20</i>
  </li><li class="chg flat">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Ships pull requests</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">發 pull request</span></span>
    <b>11% → 27%</b>
    <i>▲ 16</i>
  </li><li class="chg flat">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Uses skills</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">使用 skills</span></span>
    <b>2% → 10%</b>
    <i>▲ 8</i>
  </li><li class="chg flat">
    <span><span data-l="en" lang="en">Connects MCP tools</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">串接 MCP 工具</span></span>
    <b>4% → 11%</b>
    <i>▲ 7</i>
  </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="last-tips">
            <span data-l="en" lang="en">Suggested last time: State the expected result first · Paste the error line</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">上次的建議: State the expected result first · Paste the error line</span>
          </p>
  </div>
                </section>

          <section>
            <h2><span data-l="en" lang="en">Five dimensions</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">五個面向</span></h2>
            <div class="dims">
              <details open class="dimension">
    <summary><span class="dim-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Work style</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">工作風格</span></span>
    <span class="dim-main">
      <span class="dim-title"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Work style</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">工作風格</span></span>
      <span class="dim-summary"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Plans first, then breaks big tasks into small steps.</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">先規劃，再把大任務拆成小步驟。</span></span>
    </span>
    <span class="badge"><span data-l="en" lang="en">1 quote</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">1 段引文</span></span></summary>
    <div class="dim-body">
      <ul class="evidence">
    <li><blockquote>don&#39;t write code yet, break the plan into small steps</blockquote></li>
  </ul>
    </div>
  </details><details open class="dimension">
    <summary><span class="dim-name"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Communication</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">溝通</span></span>
    <span class="dim-main">
      <span class="dim-title"><span data-l="en" lang="en">Communication</span><span data-l="zh-TW" lang="zh-Hant-TW">溝通</span></span>
